so s b ≈ 0 for confident samples and s b ≈ 1 for difficult ones, while remaining strictly bounded in [0 , 1] . Token-level and sample-level signals are thus complementary: w BFT b,t allocates budget within a sequence based on relative local difficulty, while s b allocates budget across sequences based on absolute biomedical hardness.


